  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before: separate wallpapers for light and dark mode that switch automatically when Light Switch changes the theme. The maintainers closed the newer reports as duplicates of the original request (#42401), and the earlier ones were tied to #42436 and #44598. A maintainer said in January 2026 (#44867) that this would be supported in a following release, and a contributor (#42436) mentioned a prototype for wallpaper switching (#42624). Please check the latest PowerToys release and the Light Switch settings for the wallpaper option. If it isn't there, follow or add a thumbs-up to #42401 rather than opening a new request. Until then, tools like AutoDarkMode, or a Task Scheduler script, can switch the wallpaper along with the theme."
